  "target": "recorded dengue case count in the next calendar month",
  "forecast_horizon": "one calendar month ahead",
  "geographic_unit": "each of Iligan City's 44 barangays",
  "hotspot_definition": "At a forecast issue cutoff in calendar month t, DengueWatch uses the dengue case and weather information available by that cutoff to estimate the recorded dengue case count in calendar month t+1 for each of Iligan City's 44 barangays (one barangay-month prediction, one calendar month ahead). The target is the observed case-record count in the following month, not a risk label calculated from the input month's count. A barangay is flagged for planning review if its estimated t+1 count is at least 7; evaluation labels an observed hotspot at 6 or more actual cases. These are internal project thresholds, not official DOH outbreak definitions. If month t is still underway, confirmed month-to-date cases are used and the estimate is provisional. Forecasts support planning and require health-personnel review before operational action.",
  "hotspot_threshold_cases": 6,
  "predicted_hotspot_cutoff_cases": 7,
  "algorithm": "RandomForestRegressor",
  "scikit_learn_version": "1.9.0",
  "pandas_version": "3.0.5",
  "preprocessing_fit_policy": "For candidate selection, preprocessing is fitted on training months only and applied to validation months. For the final test evaluation, preprocessing is fitted on the earlier training plus validation months; final-test rows are never used to fit preprocessing or select parameters.",
  "temporal_partition_policy": "Partitions are chronological and grouped by whole reference calendar month, so all barangays from the same month remain in one partition.",
  "final_test_policy": "Hyperparameters are selected on validation data; the later-period holdout is not used for parameter selection within a run. This holdout has been inspected in prior project iterations and is not an untouched independent test for new changes. Deployment refitting occurs only after metrics are recorded.",
  "forecast_issue_information_policy": "Predictors are limited to the issue-month case/weather values and lagged values available at that forecast cutoff; the next-month target and all later observations are excluded from features.",
  "final_deployment_fit_policy": "After the later-period holdout score is recorded, the deployment pipeline is refit on all available usable historical rows.",
  "random_state": 42,
  "warning": "Planning-support forecast only; validate with authorized health personnel. It must not be used as a confirmed outbreak or an automatic alert.",
  "source_data_quality_note": "No unverified empty barangay-month cells were used for this training run. 1398 empty cells were treated as zero under the user's dataset-completeness confirmation; no separate CHO zero-report register was provided."
